amily. You explore a forgotten world, collect curiosities and solve puzzles that open the way deeper into the cold. The monsters of local legend are not all enemies, and some can be befriended.\n\nThe story deals with loss and redemption, and the stylized, storybook look gives R\u00f6ki the feel of a dark fairy tale. It is a single-player game with full controller support, suited to players who like atmospheric, exploration-driven adventures and are happy to move at a measured pace."}}